rem Prime Power Triples
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=87
rem Count numbers below a limit that are
rem a prime square plus a prime cube
rem plus a prime fourth power

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Limit integer = 50000000

Side = Limit isqrt + 1
Ps = primes till Side array
Sq = (Ps ** 2) filter less Limit array
Cb = (Ps ** 3) filter less Limit array
Fo = (Ps ** 4) filter less Limit array
Pair = Sq Cb outer +
Sums = Pair Fo outer +
Few = Sums (Sums less Limit)
Answer = Few unique len
Answer print
